# DUB.SAR 1.0 — Persistent Tablet Sequences (Scholar Mode)
# Demonstrates inscribing a working sequence and consulting persistent entries.

problem:

    working powers of length 0
    append 1 to powers
    append 2 to powers
    append 4 to powers
    append 8 to powers
    append 16 to powers

    inscribe tablet powers

    consult tablet "powers"
    n : length of powers
    first_power : first from powers
    last_power : last from powers

result:

    n
    first_power
    last_power
